window.__code__["security-tool-guard-execution-level-py-21"] = {"code_id": "security-tool-guard-execution-level-py-21", "kind": "src", "title": "execution_level.py:21", "source_path": "QwenPaw-main/src/qwenpaw/security/tool_guard/execution_level.py", "highlight_line": 21, "code_html": "<div class=\"code-body\">\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"1\"><span class=\"c-no\">1</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-com\"># -*- coding: utf-8 -*-</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"2\"><span class=\"c-no\">2</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Tool execution security levels <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> QwenPaw agent.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"3\"><span class=\"c-no\">3</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"4\"><span class=\"c-no\">4</span><span class=\"c-src\">Defines different approval strategies <span class=\"c-kw\">for</span> tool execution:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"5\"><span class=\"c-no\">5</span><span class=\"c-src\">- STRICT: All tools require approval</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"6\"><span class=\"c-no\">6</span><span class=\"c-src\">- SMART: Low-risk tools auto-allowed, medium+ require approval</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"7\"><span class=\"c-no\">7</span><span class=\"c-src\">- AUTO: Only guarded_tools require approval (backward compatible)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"8\"><span class=\"c-no\">8</span><span class=\"c-src\">- OFF: Tool guard completely disabled</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"9\"><span class=\"c-no\">9</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"10\"><span class=\"c-no\">10</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> __future__ <span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> annotations</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"11\"><span class=\"c-no\">11</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"12\"><span class=\"c-no\">12</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> enum <span class=\"c-kw\">import</span> Enum</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"13\"><span class=\"c-no\">13</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"14\"><span class=\"c-no\">14</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"15\"><span class=\"c-no\">15</span><span class=\"c-src\"><span class=\"c-kw\">class</span> ToolExecutionLevel(str, Enum):</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"16\"><span class=\"c-no\">16</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Tool execution security level.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"17\"><span class=\"c-no\">17</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"18\"><span class=\"c-no\">18</span><span class=\"c-src\">    Controls when tools require user approval before execution.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"19\"><span class=\"c-no\">19</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"20\"><span class=\"c-no\">20</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"21\"><span class=\"c-no\">21</span><span class=\"c-src\">    STRICT = <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;strict&quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"22\"><span class=\"c-no\">22</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;All tools require approval (highest security).</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"23\"><span class=\"c-no\">23</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"24\"><span class=\"c-no\">24</span><span class=\"c-src\">    Use case: Production environments, high-security deployments.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"25\"><span class=\"c-no\">25</span><span class=\"c-src\">    Behavior: Even INFO-level findings trigger approval flow.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"26\"><span class=\"c-no\">26</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"27\"><span class=\"c-no\">27</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"28\"><span class=\"c-no\">28</span><span class=\"c-src\">    SMART = <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;smart&quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"29\"><span class=\"c-no\">29</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Low-risk tools auto-allowed, medium+ require approval (recommended).</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"30\"><span class=\"c-no\">30</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"31\"><span class=\"c-no\">31</span><span class=\"c-src\">    Use case: Balanced security <span class=\"c-kw\">and</span> productivity (default recommended).</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"32\"><span class=\"c-no\">32</span><span class=\"c-src\">    Behavior:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"33\"><span class=\"c-no\">33</span><span class=\"c-src\">        - INFO/LOW severity: auto-allow</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"34\"><span class=\"c-no\">34</span><span class=\"c-src\">        - MEDIUM/HIGH/CRITICAL severity: require approval</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"35\"><span class=\"c-no\">35</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"36\"><span class=\"c-no\">36</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"37\"><span class=\"c-no\">37</span><span class=\"c-src\">    AUTO = <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;auto&quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"38\"><span class=\"c-no\">38</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Only explicitly guarded tools require approval (backward compatible).</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"39\"><span class=\"c-no\">39</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"40\"><span class=\"c-no\">40</span><span class=\"c-src\">    Use case: Current behavior, legacy compatibility.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"41\"><span class=\"c-no\">41</span><span class=\"c-src\">    Behavior: Only tools <span class=\"c-kw\">in</span> guarded_tools list are checked.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"42\"><span class=\"c-no\">42</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"43\"><span class=\"c-no\">43</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"44\"><span class=\"c-no\">44</span><span class=\"c-src\">    OFF = <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;off&quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"45\"><span class=\"c-no\">45</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Tool guard completely disabled (no protection).</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"46\"><span class=\"c-no\">46</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"47\"><span class=\"c-no\">47</span><span class=\"c-src\">    Use case: Development/testing, fully trusted environments.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"48\"><span class=\"c-no\">48</span><span class=\"c-src\">    Behavior: All tools execute immediately without any checks.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"49\"><span class=\"c-no\">49</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"50\"><span class=\"c-no\">50</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"51\"><span class=\"c-no\">51</span><span class=\"c-src\">    @classmethod</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"52\"><span class=\"c-no\">52</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> from_config(cls, value: str | <span class=\"c-kw\">None</span>) -&gt; <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;ToolExecutionLevel&quot;</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"53\"><span class=\"c-no\">53</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;Parse execution level <span class=\"c-kw\">from</span> config string.</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"54\"><span class=\"c-no\">54</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"55\"><span class=\"c-no\">55</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Args:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"56\"><span class=\"c-no\">56</span><span class=\"c-src\">            value: Config value (case-insensitive)</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"57\"><span class=\"c-no\">57</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"58\"><span class=\"c-no\">58</span><span class=\"c-src\">        Returns:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"59\"><span class=\"c-no\">59</span><span class=\"c-src\">            ToolExecutionLevel enum value, defaults to AUTO <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> invalid</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"60\"><span class=\"c-no\">60</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span>&quot;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"61\"><span class=\"c-no\">61</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">if</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">not</span> value:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"62\"><span class=\"c-no\">62</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> cls.AUTO</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"63\"><span class=\"c-no\">63</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"64\"><span class=\"c-no\">64</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">try</span>:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"65\"><span class=\"c-no\">65</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> cls(value.lower().strip())</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"66\"><span class=\"c-no\">66</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">except</span> ValueError:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"67\"><span class=\"c-no\">67</span><span class=\"c-src\">            <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> cls.AUTO</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"68\"><span class=\"c-no\">68</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"69\"><span class=\"c-no\">69</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> requires_approval_for_all_tools(<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>) -&gt; bool:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"70\"><span class=\"c-no\">70</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span><span class=\"c-str\">&quot;Check if this level requires approval for all tools.&quot;</span><span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"71\"><span class=\"c-no\">71</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span> == ToolExecutionLevel.STRICT</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"72\"><span class=\"c-no\">72</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"73\"><span class=\"c-no\">73</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> is_disabled(<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>) -&gt; bool:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"74\"><span class=\"c-no\">74</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span><span class=\"c-str\">&quot;Check if tool guard is completely disabled.&quot;</span><span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"75\"><span class=\"c-no\">75</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span> == ToolExecutionLevel.OFF</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"76\"><span class=\"c-no\">76</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"77\"><span class=\"c-no\">77</span><span class=\"c-src\">    <span class=\"c-kw\">def</span> is_smart_mode(<span class=\"c-kw\">self</span>) -&gt; bool:</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"78\"><span class=\"c-no\">78</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span><span class=\"c-str\">&quot;Check if using smart risk-based approval.&quot;</span><span class=\"c-str\">&quot;&quot;</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"79\"><span class=\"c-no\">79</span><span class=\"c-src\">        <span class=\"c-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"c-kw\">self</span> == ToolExecutionLevel.SMART</span></div>\n<div class=\"c-line\" data-line=\"80\"><span class=\"c-no\">80</span><span class=\"c-src\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n</div>", "lines": 80, "explanation": "ToolExecutionLevel 四档：STRICT（所有工具都要审批）、SMART（低危自动放行中危+审批）、AUTO（仅 guarded 审批，默认）、OFF（全关）。配 tool_guard YAML 规则（rm -rf、curl|sh 拦截）+ ApprovalService 人在回路。执行类工具危险拦截前置。", "knowledge_points": [{"title": "权限与沙箱", "body": "PolicyGuardedTool 策略引擎 + STRICT/SMART/AUTO/OFF 四档执行级别 + 内核级沙箱（macOS Seatbelt / Linux bubblewrap·landlock / Windows AppContainer）防 prompt 注入逃逸；ApprovalService 人在回路。"}], "related_docs": ["09-权限与沙箱"]};
